#: inc/core/Admin/Help.php:167
#, php-format
msgid "Only single line text, drop down, radio button and checkbox fields count as the subject, and never a field a notification takes its sender or recipient from: From Name, From Email, Reply To, Send To, BCC. The default notification, %s, cites no field: such a form has no subject until a notification cites one or a field carries the class."
